@startuml i3-telephony-dds-call-state
' The DdsCall machine of docs/hld/80-telephony.md §80.3.2 (D23, E6b). One instance per call_id.
' Labels read: trigger [guard] / who may fire. Every accepted transition except ring appends one
' event (start → DDS_CALL_STARTED, answer → DDS_CALL_ANSWERED, no_answer | busy | hang_up →
' DDS_CALL_ENDED). The leg machine (SERVICE_RESPONSE_TRANSITIONS) is untouched.

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<terminal>> #EEEEEE
  BackgroundColor<<live>> #FFF6EF
}

title DdsCall — one call (kind SERVICE_HEAD | CLAIMANT | OPERATOR_112)

state "DIALING" as DIALING
state "RINGING" as RINGING
state "CONNECTED" as CONNECTED <<live>>
state "ENDED" as ENDED <<terminal>>

[*] --> DIALING : start\n[guard_dds_call_allowed: ACTIVE, DDS stage started,\ndds_brigade_call = ON, plays_leg (SERVICE_HEAD),\nno other live call of this user]\n/ TRAINEE (OUTBOUND), SIMULATION (INBOUND CALL_IN step)
DIALING --> RINGING : ring\n[guard_dds_call_transport_ready:\nLiveKit ∧ agent heartbeat;\nendpoint SIP ⇒ gateway leg UP]\n/ SIMULATION
RINGING --> CONNECTED : answer\n[actor matches direction]\n/ SIMULATION (AI callee, after answer_after_ms),\nTRAINEE (INBOUND)
RINGING --> ENDED : no_answer\n[persona / script no_answer;\nINBOUND ring_timeout_ms]\n/ SIMULATION
RINGING --> ENDED : busy\n[script busy; CLAIMANT while the\n112 call is RINGING / CONNECTED]\n/ SIMULATION
DIALING --> ENDED : hang_up\n/ TRAINEE (HANGUP), SYSTEM (ABORT | TRANSPORT_LOST)
RINGING --> ENDED : hang_up\n/ TRAINEE, SYSTEM
CONNECTED --> ENDED : hang_up\n/ TRAINEE (HANGUP), SYSTEM (ABORT | TRANSPORT_LOST)
ENDED --> [*]

note right of CONNECTED
  While CONNECTED the agent runs, per (session_id, call_id):
  CLAIMANT → the frozen caller chain (speaker label «ДИСПЕТЧЕР»);
  SERVICE_HEAD / OPERATOR_112 → the responder chain.
  A SERVICE_HEAD call may append DDS_CALL_STATUS_PROPOSED
  (due steps only) and DDS_CALL_ASSERTION; the trainee confirms
  with set_service_status {proposed_by_call_id}.
end note

note left of ENDED
  end_reason: HANGUP | NO_ANSWER | BUSY | ABORT | TRANSPORT_LOST.
  A call still DIALING / RINGING when the DDS stage completes
  is ended by SYSTEM (ABORT) in the same Unit of Work.
  Any trigger not drawn ⇒ 409 INVALID_TRANSITION (INV 8).
end note

note top of DIALING
  Reserved hook (owner Q1, sub-epic E6g, not in I3):
  kind OPERATOR_112 with answered_by TRAINEE.
end note

@enduml
